{"version":1,"content":"<p>據供應鏈最新消息，蘋果正在推動一種全新的OLED面板製造工藝，未來有望為iPhone和iPad帶來亮度更高、顯示效果更出色的屏幕。隨着蘋果持續推進全產品線向OLED顯示技術轉型，新一代OLED面板或將成為其顯示戰略的重要升級方向。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584872.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.034703+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:34:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.353581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.353581+00:00","content_hash":"94290b99352bd98c02e42e1ec3e60f0958b58337ff56bce3c18a4704e98ce3a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}